{"seq":2,"slug":"category-margin-turnover-target","title":"品类毛利/周转目标与预算约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/open-to-buy-budget/category-margin-turnover-target","wordCount":2273,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"品类毛利-周转目标与预算约束\">品类毛利/周转目标与预算约束</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OTB 的额度不是凭空来的，它由两个财务目标共同决定：<strong>这个品类要贡献多少毛利</strong>，以及<strong>这笔库存一年要转几圈</strong>。毛利率与周转率是零售财务里最常被分开讨论、却必须一起优化的两个数，因为单独优化任一个都会把品类带向荒谬的极端。</p>\n<p>只追毛利率，会得到一堆高毛利但卖不动的商品——库存压着、资金占着、最后靠清仓收场，实际毛利回收远低于账面。只追周转率，会得到一堆便宜、快销、毛利极薄的商品——转得很快但每个循环赚得极少，且高度依赖持续的流量投入。两者一起看，才是这门生意真正的效率。</p>\n<p>跨境场景又加了两项国内零售不常显式处理的成本：<strong>关税与头程运费</strong>构成到岸成本的一部分，<strong>跨境退货的二次履约成本</strong>直接从贡献毛利里扣。这两项让&quot;账面毛利率健康&quot;的品类可能在扣完后变成负贡献。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gmroi-把两个目标合成一个数\">GMROI：把两个目标合成一个数</h2><h3 id=\"定义与等价形式\">定义与等价形式</h3><p>毛利投资回报率（GMROI / GMROII）回答的问题是：&quot;每投入一个单位的库存成本，一年能产生多少毛利？&quot;其基本形式是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GMROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>年度毛利额</mtext><mtext>平均库存成本</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GMROI} = \\frac{\\text{年度毛利额}}{\\text{平均库存成本}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均库存成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年度毛利额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个比值有三种等价写法，可以用来互相校验口径：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Margin</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>Margin</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>年周转次数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{Margin}\\%}{100\\%-\\text{Margin}\\%} \\times \\text{年周转次数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4522em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9711em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">100%</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Margin</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">%</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Margin</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">%</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年周转次数</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>Margin</mtext><mtext>COGS</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>年周转次数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{Margin}}{\\text{COGS}} \\times \\text{年周转次数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2694em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9244em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">COGS</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Margin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年周转次数</span></span></span></span></span></span>、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Margin</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>销售额</mtext><mtext>平均库存成本</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Margin}\\% \\times \\frac{\\text{销售额}}{\\text{平均库存成本}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Margin</span></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">平均库存成本</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">销售额</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>；三者都可以化简为 毛利额 / 平均库存成本（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GMROI\">GMROII，Wikipedia</a>）。其中 Margin% 指毛利占销售额的比例，年周转次数指销货成本除以平均库存成本。</p>\n<p>三式等价这一点有很强的实用价值：它意味着<strong>你可以从毛利率与周转率这两个容易沟通的数反推 GMROI</strong>，而不必每次都去对账毛利额与库存成本。品类规划会上讨论&quot;把毛利率从 32% 提到 35%、同时接受周转从 6 次降到 5 次&quot;时，双方能立刻算出 GMROI 是升还是降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-gmroi-做品类排序的取舍\">用 GMROI 做品类排序的取舍</h3><p>按 GMROI 排序会得到与按毛利率或按周转率完全不同的次序。构造一个对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>毛利率</th>\n<th>年周转次数</th>\n<th>推算 GMROI</th>\n<th>排序（GMROI）</th>\n<th>排序（毛利率）</th>\n<th>排序（周转）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A 高毛利慢销</td>\n<td>52%</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td>3.25</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 中毛利中速</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>6.0</td>\n<td>3.23</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 薄毛利快销</td>\n<td>18%</td>\n<td>12.0</td>\n<td>2.63</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D 厚毛利极慢</td>\n<td>60%</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>1.80</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1*</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E 负毛利快销</td>\n<td>8%</td>\n<td>15.0</td>\n<td>1.30</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推算方式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{m}{1-m} \\times t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0987em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。D 与 A 毛利率接近但周转差 2.5 倍，GMROI 差近一倍——这正是只看毛利率会漏掉的差距。E 品类的 GMROI 仍大于 1，说明它虽然薄利但仍能覆盖库存占用，不应简单砍掉，而应考虑提价或降本。</p>\n<p>负毛利率的品类 GMROI 为负，无论周转多快都应当先解决定价或成本问题，而不是靠&quot;卖得多&quot;来摊薄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算约束下的目标设定\">预算约束下的目标设定</h2><h3 id=\"目标不能独立设定\">目标不能独立设定</h3><p>毛利率目标与周转目标不能分别拍定，因为它们共享同一个约束：<strong>采购预算（OTB）</strong>。给定 OTB 额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 与目标 GMROI <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，该品类可产生的年度毛利额上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G \\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（按平均库存近似）。反过来说，如果品类被要求贡献毛利额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 而只拿到额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，则隐含要求的 GMROI 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M / B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>——这个数如果超过品类历史可达水平，目标本身不成立。</p>\n<p>把这条约束显式写进计划表，可以避免&quot;既要毛利额又要降库存&quot;这种自相矛盾的指标下发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def check_target_feasibility(otb_budget, target_gm_amount,&#10;                             hist_margin_pct, hist_turns):&#10;    implied_gmroi = target_gm_amount / otb_budget&#10;    hist_gmroi = hist_margin_pct / (1 - hist_margin_pct) * hist_turns&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;implied_gmroi&quot;: round(implied_gmroi, 3),&#10;        &quot;historical_gmroi&quot;: round(hist_gmroi, 3),&#10;        &quot;stretch_ratio&quot;: round(implied_gmroi / hist_gmroi, 3)&#10;        if hist_gmroi else None,&#10;        &quot;feasible&quot;: implied_gmroi &lt;= hist_gmroi * 1.15,&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_target_feasibility</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(otb_budget, target_gm_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                             hist_margin_pct, hist_turns):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    implied_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_gm_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otb_budget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hist_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_margin_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_margin_pct) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_turns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"implied_gmroi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(implied_gmroi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"historical_gmroi\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hist_gmroi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"stretch_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(implied_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_gmroi, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"feasible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: implied_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hist_gmroi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stretch_ratio</code> 超过 1.15 视为不可行，需要调低毛利目标或调高 OTB 额度。1.15 这个系数是&quot;一年内可实现的改善幅度&quot;的经验上界，应当按品类历史改善速度校准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"毛利预算的双重身份\">毛利预算的双重身份</h3><p>品类毛利目标同时是<strong>收入承诺</strong>与<strong>降价预算的来源</strong>。清仓降价的每一分钱都从毛利里扣，因此毛利目标的设定必须预留降价预算：计划毛利额是&quot;扣掉计划降价之后的净额&quot;。很多品类的年度毛利目标在编制时没有预留降价，导致下半年为了清仓把利润吃光。</p>\n<p>这种预留口径与清仓降价预算的编制是同一件事的两面；清仓侧&quot;降价预算如何按边际效率分配到 SKU&quot;的具体方法属于相邻 hub 的职责，本 hub 只负责把计划降价作为毛利目标的减项纳入预算表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到岸成本与跨境特有扣项\">到岸成本与跨境特有扣项</h2><h3 id=\"贡献毛利的完整构成\">贡献毛利的完整构成</h3><p>跨境品类的贡献毛利在扣项上比国内多。逐层扣减的顺序决定了&quot;毛利&quot;这个词在不同语境下的含义：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[售价] --&gt; B[减 商品出厂成本]&#10;  B --&gt; C[减 头程运费]&#10;  C --&gt; D[减 关税与进口税费]&#10;  D --&gt; E[减 履约与尾程派送]&#10;  E --&gt; F[减 支付通道费]&#10;  F --&gt; G[减 退货损失与二次履约]&#10;  G --&gt; H[减 平台佣金]&#10;  H --&gt; I[贡献毛利 before markdown]&#10;  I --&gt; J[减 计划降价]&#10;  J --&gt; K[贡献毛利 after markdown]&#10;  K --&gt; L[减 分摊固定成本]&#10;  L --&gt; M[品类经营利润]\">graph TD\n  A[售价] --&gt; B[减 商品出厂成本]\n  B --&gt; C[减 头程运费]\n  C --&gt; D[减 关税与进口税费]\n  D --&gt; E[减 履约与尾程派送]\n  E --&gt; F[减 支付通道费]\n  F --&gt; G[减 退货损失与二次履约]\n  G --&gt; H[减 平台佣金]\n  H --&gt; I[贡献毛利 before markdown]\n  I --&gt; J[减 计划降价]\n  J --&gt; K[贡献毛利 after markdown]\n  K --&gt; L[减 分摊固定成本]\n  L --&gt; M[品类经营利润]</pre><p>规划时最常用的两个口径是 <code>I</code>（不含降价的贡献毛利，用于选品与定价）与 <code>K</code>（含降价的贡献毛利，用于编制毛利目标与复盘）。两个口径混用是跨品类复盘中最常见的对不上的原因。</p>\n<p>贡献毛利的定义是单位售价减单位变动成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = P - V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，衡量单笔销售在覆盖固定成本前的贡献；正贡献毛利的商品线即使整体利润为负也仍值得保留，而负贡献毛利的商品线每多卖一件就多亏一件（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contribution_margin\">Contribution margin，Wikipedia</a>）。跨境场景里 <code>V</code> 必须包含上图中的 B 到 H 全部变动项，而不是只含出厂成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退货率的杠杆效应\">退货率的杠杆效应</h3><p>退货在跨境场景的杠杆远超直觉，因为它同时消耗三笔钱：正向履约成本、逆向物流成本、以及退回商品的贬值。设退货率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、单件退货净损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（逆向物流加贬值），则有效贡献毛利为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = (1-r)(P - V) - r \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P - V = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时有效贡献为 12；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span> 时变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2.25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9 - 2.25 = 6.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.75</span></span></span></span></span>，接近腰斩。这解释了为什么按毛利率排序的品类在跨境场景常常误导：它看不到退货率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标下达与偏差处理\">目标下达与偏差处理</h2><h3 id=\"分档目标而非统一目标\">分档目标而非统一目标</h3><p>不同品类历史水平差异巨大，用统一的毛利率与周转目标下发必然一半达标一半不达标，且不达标的那一半通常是结构性的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类档位</th>\n<th>毛利率目标</th>\n<th>周转目标</th>\n<th>GMROI 下限</th>\n<th>适用说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形象款</td>\n<td>高（≥45%）</td>\n<td>低（≤3）</td>\n<td>1.6</td>\n<td>接受低周转换取定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利润款</td>\n<td>中高（35–45%）</td>\n<td>中（4–8）</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td>主力承担毛利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量款</td>\n<td>低（15–25%）</td>\n<td>高（≥10）</td>\n<td>2.2</td>\n<td>靠周转与流量外溢获利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防御款</td>\n<td>低（10–20%）</td>\n<td>中（4–8）</td>\n<td>1.5</td>\n<td>明确记为防守成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾补充</td>\n<td>中（30–40%）</td>\n<td>低（≤4）</td>\n<td>2.0</td>\n<td>覆盖需求空间，容忍低效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分档与 <a href=\"../category-role-structure/traffic-profit-image-defender-role\">品类角色</a> 一一对应，这使得&quot;这个品类没达标&quot;的讨论能立刻回到&quot;它的角色允许什么范围&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"偏差归因\">偏差归因</h3><p>偏差必须拆成&quot;价&quot;与&quot;量&quot;两部分，否则复盘会陷入互相指责。用价差与量差的分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>act</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>act</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>毛利率偏差</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>act</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>plan</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>规模偏差</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M = \\underbrace{(m_{\\text{act}} - m_{\\text{plan}}) \\cdot S_{\\text{act}}}_{\\text{毛利率偏差}} + \\underbrace{(S_{\\text{act}} - S_{\\text{plan}}) \\cdot m_{\\text{plan}}}_{\\text{规模偏差}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3624em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">毛利率偏差</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">act</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">act</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3624em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">规模偏差</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">act</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">plan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两项的处置完全不同：毛利率偏差要查价格与成本（含到岸成本、退货、降价），规模偏差要查需求预测与曝光。把两者混成一个&quot;没达标&quot;，等于放弃了修复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>毛利率与周转率必须一起优化；GMROI 把两者合成一个数，且有三条等价写法可用于口径互校，其基本形式是 年度毛利额 / 平均库存成本。</li>\n<li>品类目标不能独立设定——毛利额目标与 OTB 额度共同隐含一个 GMROI 要求，超出历史水平 15% 以上即为不可行。</li>\n<li>毛利目标必须预留降价预算，否则清仓季会把全年利润吃光。</li>\n<li>跨境的贡献毛利要逐层扣减出厂成本、头程、关税、履约、支付费、退货与平台佣金；规划常用&quot;含降价&quot;与&quot;不含降价&quot;两个口径，不可混用。</li>\n<li>退货率对贡献毛利是杠杆效应：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = (1-r)(P-V) - rL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，25% 退货率可腰斩有效贡献。</li>\n<li>目标应按品类角色分档下达；偏差复盘要把毛利率偏差与规模偏差拆开归因。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"品类毛利/周转目标与预算约束","id":"品类毛利-周转目标与预算约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GMROI：把两个目标合成一个数","id":"gmroi-把两个目标合成一个数"},{"level":3,"text":"定义与等价形式","id":"定义与等价形式"},{"level":3,"text":"用 GMROI 做品类排序的取舍","id":"用-gmroi-做品类排序的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"预算约束下的目标设定","id":"预算约束下的目标设定"},{"level":3,"text":"目标不能独立设定","id":"目标不能独立设定"},{"level":3,"text":"毛利预算的双重身份","id":"毛利预算的双重身份"},{"level":2,"text":"到岸成本与跨境特有扣项","id":"到岸成本与跨境特有扣项"},{"level":3,"text":"贡献毛利的完整构成","id":"贡献毛利的完整构成"},{"level":3,"text":"退货率的杠杆效应","id":"退货率的杠杆效应"},{"level":2,"text":"目标下达与偏差处理","id":"目标下达与偏差处理"},{"level":3,"text":"分档目标而非统一目标","id":"分档目标而非统一目标"},{"level":3,"text":"偏差归因","id":"偏差归因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Open-to-Buy 预算与品类分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/open-to-buy-budget/open-to-buy-category-budget"},"next":{"title":"OTB 与采购/预测协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/open-to-buy-budget/otb-procurement-forecast-link"}}